sentences.text:
The present application is filed under Section 483 of the Bhartiya Nagrik Suraksha Sanhit, 2023,
for regular bail in connection with FIR being C.R.NO. 11191067240076 of 2024 registered with Cyber Crime Police Station, Ahmedabad for the offences punishable under Sections 406, 420,
120(B) of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 66(c) & 66(d) of the Information Technology Act.

